# Summary

The charter includes a section titled "Membership fee". [[cite:obs-de35550c533823877e46988a38ea2dbeb1b1c6ff "## Membership fee"]]

It states that "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter." [[cite:obs-de35550c533823877e46988a38ea2dbeb1b1c6ff "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

Each member therefore pays a yearly contribution. [[cite:obs-de35550c533823877e46988a38ea2dbeb1b1c6ff "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

The charter specifies that the specific amount is fixed in the annex of this charter (and thus is not stated as a numeric value in the main text). [[cite:obs-de35550c533823877e46988a38ea2dbeb1b1c6ff "the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

